OL,3,GNEWSATeen killed peacemaker with punch
OL,4,Aon night out
OL,5,
OL,6,FA killer who fatally punched a
OL,7,Fpeacemaker trying to break up a fight
OL,8,Fon a night out has been jailed for four
OL,9,Fyears and 10 months.
OL,11,FEthan Cockram was 19 when he struck
OL,12,FSimon Beston to the side of the face,
OL,13,Fcausing the 55-year-old grandfather to
OL,14,Ffall and hit his head on a kerb in
OL,15,FNewcastle city centre, the city's crown
OL,16,Fcourt heard.
OL,18,FThe victim's family said they could
OL,19,Fnever forgive his killer and felt
OL,20,F"anger and disgust" Cockram and his
OL,21,Faccomplices had been able to carry on
OL,22,Fenjoying their lives.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
