OL,3,GNEWSATeen killed peacemaker with punch
OL,4,Aon night out
OL,5,
OL,6,FNow 21, Cockram, who at the time of the
OL,7,Fkilling was on bail for punching two
OL,8,Fother men on a night out, admitted
OL,9,Fmanslaughter. Lola Charlton and Shayne
OL,10,FCook, both 20, admitted affray.
